  <menu>
    <note>
      <line t="A wedding repast after the manner of Bartolomeo Scappi, cook to Popes (Opera, 1570),"/>
      <line t="served in four services, turn and turn about from the cold credenza and the hot kitchen."/>
      <line t="Wines of Valpolicella and Soave; to close, hippocras and sugared almonds (confetti)."/>
      <line t="Almonds, verjuice and sweet spices dress many dishes: ask the steward if in doubt."/>
    </note>
    <course name="From the credenza">
      <dish id="1" name="Prosciutto with fresh figs and melon" suits="gf df nf"/>
